------------------------------------------------------------------------

Steps for running BusTalk simulations. 

Ensure that the following variables are set as per the user's
local environment settings.

setenv GLOBAL         <global_dir_path>        - The path to the shared files.

setenv FILES_VERILOG  <verilog_udp_path>       - The location of the Verilog Udp file. 
setenv DIRS_VERILOG   <verilog_library_path>   - The location of the Verilog cell library.

setenv LIB_SYNOP      <synopsys_library_path>  - The location of the Synopsys target library.

setenv PERIPH         <Peripheralname>         - The peripheral name e.g. Uart 

Additionally set the following environment variables to control
simulations:

Rtl Simulations
---------------
setenv SIMULATOR   modelsim, LDV
setenv HDL_SOURCE  verilog

Netlist Simulations
-------------------
setenv SIMULATOR   modelsim, LDV
setenv TEST_METH   noscan, scanready, scaninsert
setenv HDL_SOURCE  verilog
setenv HDL_NETL    vhdl, verilog

1. VERILOG RTL simulations (For both modelsim & LDV simulations)
----------------------------------------------------------------
- To compile all of the test patterns, in the top level directory,

  'make default'

  For individual tests, in the verification/bustest directory

  'make <testname>'

  where <testname> refers to the specific test vector set
  that needs to be used for simulations.

  [Please refer to verification/bustest/makefile for the 
   complete list of <testnames>.]

  This will create verification/bustest/invec/bif.sim

- In the verification directory

  'make rtl'


2. VERILOG NETLIST simulations (For both modelsim & LDV simulations)
--------------------------------------------------------------------
- In the verification/bustest directory 'make <testname>'
  where <testname> refers to the specific test vector set
  that needs to be used for simulations.

  [Please refer to verification/bustest/makefile for the 
   complete list of <testnames>.]

  This will create verification/bustest/invec/bif.sim

- In the verification directory
  'make <net_case>'

  where case is min, typ or max.


